Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.10) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * The service cycle runs every 30 s instead of 5 s by default. Each cycle
     reads every VMID of every group; with 20 VMIDs the old default cost
     about 600 Proxmox API requests and 7 % of a CPU core per minute. Set
     loopInterval in vdiConfig.json to keep the old value.
